      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Image edit: start here",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. In Load Image, choose the picture you want to edit. The bundled assets/elephant-1024-full.png is an optional example; upload it first if you want to use that example.\n\n2. Write an edit instruction in TextEncodeQwenImage21, referring to the source as <image1>.\n\n3. Queue the workflow. Qwen Image 2.1 supplies reference conditioning and the latent canvas; Ciru accelerates the MODEL connection.\n\nStart with 30 sampler steps and 30 full evaluations for a full edit. To try faster experimental edits, enable allow_edit_prediction and lower full_evaluations (12/30 was tested). At 1024, auto keeps native attention."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "markdown": "1. In Load Image, choose the picture you want to edit. The bundled assets/elephant-1024-full.png is an optional example; upload it first if you want to use that example.\n\n2. Write an edit instruction in TextEncodeQwenImage21, referring to the source as <image1>.\n\n3. Queue the workflow. Qwen Image 2.1 supplies reference conditioning and the latent canvas; Ciru accelerates the MODEL connection.\n\nStart with 30 sampler steps and 30 full evaluations for a full edit. To try faster experimental edits, enable allow_edit_prediction and lower full_evaluations (12/30 was tested). At 1024, auto keeps native attention."
      }
    }
